<aside class="panel panel--night">
  <h2 class="panel__title mb-s">Where's my file?</h2>
  <ul class="where-list small">
    <li><strong>Paperless Post</strong> Open an event's guest list and look for <em>Export spreadsheet</em>. Do it for each event whose guests you want — the replies you've collected come along. (Menu names change now and then; any spreadsheet you can download works.)</li>
    <li><strong>iPhone</strong> On iCloud.com, open Contacts, select the people, and choose Export vCard.</li>
    <li><strong>Google / Android</strong> contacts.google.com → Export → Google CSV or vCard.</li>
    <li><strong>Outlook</strong> People → Manage contacts → Export contacts.</li>
    <li><strong>Your own spreadsheet</strong> Any columns — names, emails, mobiles, households, addresses. You'll check what each column means before anything is saved.</li>
  </ul>
</aside>
